    "scenesThatPass": [
      "BLAZE: The Governor wants to meet me!\nTAMARA: Honey...the Governor's met all the girls on Bourbon Street. Dinner with ol' Earl might be worth a fur coat.\nBLAZE: To obtain such a coat, might a lady be asked to compromise her integrity?\nTAMARA: No. But a lady might be- asked to sleep with the old fart.",
      "BLAZE: Here's our stubs. We're Democrats.\nDAUGHTER OF OLD SOUTH: Aren't we all... You ladies are residents of the 8th Congressional District?\nBLAZE: Our official address is \"The Pea Patch\".\nDAUGHTER OF OLD SOUTH: Of course...",
      "BLAZE: Just pull it down. Pull ‘em all.\nDELILAH: I never did anything like that before in my whole life!\nBLAZE: It gives you quite a feeling, don't it?"
    ]
  },
